                    Confidential. Drafted by Eskin and
                    cleared by Salmon. Sent through
                        Buckley. Haig’s initials appear at the top of the
                    memorandum.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d152-f2" n="2" xml:id="d152-f2-content">
