            <note corresp="#d152-f3" n="3" xml:id="d152-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 97145 to USUN New York, April 10,
                    the Department provided a summary of Stoessel’s meeting. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy
                    File, D840712–0970)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d152-f4" n="4" xml:id="d152-f4-content">
                <p>Haig highlighted this paragraph.</p>
            </note>
